 betting on  his future success  the thing that's different about Charles  that he works according to a plan that  means that each work is thought out and  created for a specific location on the  street to exhibit in a gallery it's  necessary to find a format that  corresponds contrary to his works on the  street which carry no particular meaning  his exhibition at the open walls gallery  in Berlin is very specific about the  physical and mental barriers in our  daily lives little boxes is an  exhibition dealing with the subject of  the box as an object and also as a  symbol what interested me was to work on  the subject of containment the box is an  allegory for all of the boxes that we  pass through in our existence Charlevoix  expresses his ideas and a humorous yet  intense fashion and even as he gains in  popularity on the art scene he says he's  determined to stay true to the streets  of Paris  you
 

